<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin 4-wk T-bill yield rises to 8.396.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin 4-wk T-bill yield rises to 8.396.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at the Finance Ministry four-week t-bill auction was 8.396 percent, up from 8.185 percent in the last auction of similar bills on September 18, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said.</p>
<p>					   Sept 25	 Sept 18</p>
<p> Bids (billion crowns)	     6.536	    1.700</p>
<p> Bids accepted			 6.236	    1.700</p>
<p> Minimum yield (pct)		 8.090	    7.890</p>
<p> Average yield (pct)		 8.396	    8.185</p>
<p> Maximum yield (pct)		 8.50	     8.40</p>
<p> Maturity date			 Oct 24	   Oct 17</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
